 events is important to me. It helps my music stand out by incorporating unique perspectives and connects me better with my fans. Plus, it keeps me motivated and inspired.\n[S25T8] (dia_id: D25:8)\n\nDave: Cool, Calvin! Art is amazing how it reflects the world. Has anything caught your eye lately and made an impact on your music?\n[S25T9] (dia_id: D25:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah, for sure! Recently, I've been really inspired by some of the struggles that people go through. It's made me dig deeper into my music to try to capture those feelings.\n[S25T10] (dia_id: D25:10)","text_sha256":"c77ea1728922fa5ec30ad178dcdbc9278d03dad4bb0f008897911bb1d25474d8","timestamp":"2023-10-23T14:17:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"557de20bfece3f61e9afe8e8305a3e15c2c6f1474569dc78a6580fbb1490e746","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D28:30"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":115,"line_start":114,"source_locators":["[S28T30]"],"text_sha256":"415478bec67864151ee87b6cc5d6674dbc8a423fdf2a6d739b08c47b6d12f101"},{"dia_ids":["D28:31"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":118,"line_start":117,"source_locators":["[S28T31]"],"text_sha256":"9e0f3aa5bea4311d7d455770f98de49465beac11a62a01ba111be2fd6a68bcfc"}],"dia_ids":["D28:30","D28:31"],"evidence_id":"ev-5dd8b09a26335e7bfcc914c90cd75d357f6b07d89e3aa1e05e621d182cb91957","group_id":"session_28","line_end":118,"line_start":114,"observation_ids":["obs-0006"],"path":"/memories/cars-and-auto-work/session-28.md","query_terms":[],"rank":null,"records_sha256":"130a5a1e1b75083358ef27a98dd215a4e75c819ace6f2ee9b560ba394e0f0394","retrieval_round":8,"schema_version":1,"score":null,"section":"# Session 28","selection_ordinal":2,"session_id":"session_28","source_kind":"raw","source_locators":["[S28T30]","[S28T31]"],"source_map_sha256":"6e99115961bae06a48bfb7e82dbdcc18dc32ccf6c5ce57e3c266dfc7a5d4d574","source_records":[{"dia_id":"D28:30","global_turn_index":513,"locator":"[S28T30]","raw_turn_sha256":"7ec9385790bcc0ee5d43168a307f45d001daf6ec95da357bf8224acde5c1fad8","rendered_turn_sha256